# [cheats] bubble_bowl and cruise_bubble in Jellyfish Fields. Y throws the
# Bubble Bowl; holding L1 launches the Cruise Bubble. The shot is the missile
# leaving SpongeBob: its flight after that is not the same from run to run.

wait 2400
press b
wait 120
press y
wait 8
shot reg_cheat_bubble_bowl 0
wait 200
hold 30 l1
wait 30
shot reg_cheat_cruise_bubble 0
